stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> free
  free --> pooled: pool manager reserves
  free --> leased: cold path
  pooled --> leased: claimed by a team
  pooled --> draining: warm resource discarded
  leased --> pooled: registration undone
  leased --> draining: expiry or teardown
  draining --> quarantined: VM and port gone
  quarantined --> free: after quarantine_seconds
